WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
(Laughter)

00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:38.322
You see, he's right.

00:01:38.346 --> 00:01:40.976
I mean, there is a major
climate crisis, obviously,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.096
and I think if people don't believe it,
they should get out more.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.296
(Laughter)

00:01:47.828 --> 00:01:51.343
But I believe there is
a second climate crisis,

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:53.542
which is as severe,

00:01:53.566 --> 00:01:55.976
which has the same origins,

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.422
and that we have to deal with
with the same urgency.